{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-3150",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "三月二十日是太君两周年忌辰，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "March twentieth was the second anniversary of the Grand Lady's death,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "内大臣赴极乐寺墓地祭扫。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and the Inner Minister went to the Gokurakuji cemetery to pay his respects.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "诸公子全体随行，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "All the young lords accompanied him,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "排场十分盛大，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and the ceremony was extremely splendid,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "王侯公卿前来参与者甚多。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "with many princes and high nobles coming to take part.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "夕雾中将也在其内，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Lieutenant General Yugiri was also among them,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "其装束之华丽，决不逊于他人。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and the splendor of his attire was in no way inferior to anyone else's.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "就相貌而言，此时青春十八，正值盛年，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As for his looks, he was then eighteen, in the full bloom of youth,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "生得眉清目秀，十全其美。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "born with refined features and flawless beauty.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "只是自从与内大臣结怨以来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But ever since he had fallen out with the Inner Minister,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "每逢见面，必多顾忌。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "whenever they met, he was always full of reserve.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "今天虽来参与，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Although he had come to attend today,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "常怀戒备之心，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "he kept a constant sense of caution in his heart,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "态度十分冷静。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and his manner was very composed.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "内大臣对他则比往常更加注目。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The Inner Minister, for his part, watched him even more closely than usual.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "诵经礼忏所需供养之物，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The offerings needed for the sutra recitations and rites of repentance",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "由源氏大臣从六条院派人送来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "were sent by the Genji Minister from Rokujo-in through his attendants.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "夕雾中将尤为诚恳，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Lieutenant General Yugiri was especially earnest,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03150",
      "unit_index": 19,
      "source_text": "为外祖母经办种种供养。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "arranging all kinds of offerings for his maternal grandmother.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
